1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,280
=Episode 12=

2
00:00:09,809 --> 00:00:11,066
What is that?

3
00:00:11,522 --> 00:00:12,742
Barrier Spiritual Art.

4
00:00:16,513 --> 00:00:17,541
Is something wrong?

5
00:00:19,714 --> 00:00:20,514
These sandworms

6
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:22,418
don't usually attack travelers.

7
00:00:22,532 --> 00:00:23,980
Why are they so agitated today?

8
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:32,323
Shoot.

9
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:33,960
Why do they keep coming?

10
00:00:37,657 --> 00:00:38,876
Zhongtu suppresses Spiritual Power.

11
00:00:39,027 --> 00:00:39,638
My barrier

12
00:00:39,942 --> 00:00:40,932
is getting weaker.

13
00:00:41,238 --> 00:00:42,152
Quit whining.

14
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:43,638
Jump out now!

15
00:01:07,713 --> 00:01:08,475
Don't interfere.

16
00:01:08,704 --> 00:01:09,199
Have you forgotten?

17
00:01:10,457 --> 00:01:12,095
Zhongtu is the most crucial part.

18
00:01:12,704 --> 00:01:13,619
In all nine mirrored lives,

19
00:01:13,809 --> 00:01:15,104
this is where we failed.

20
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,742
If she fails again,

21
00:01:17,009 --> 00:01:18,341
we'll have no hope left.

22
00:01:19,751 --> 00:01:20,285
Don't worry.

23
00:01:21,009 --> 00:01:22,494
Zhongtu was once my land too.

24
00:01:22,838 --> 00:01:23,218
Now,

25
00:01:23,903 --> 00:01:25,465
it has a guardian of its own.

26
00:01:25,884 --> 00:01:27,142
That person will help them.

27
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:40,780
Jin Yunlie!

28
00:01:41,656 --> 00:01:41,922
Don't be afraid.

29
00:01:42,075 --> 00:01:42,647
I'm here.

30
00:01:52,018 --> 00:01:52,857
Are you hurt?

31
00:01:53,047 --> 00:01:53,390
No.

32
00:01:53,619 --> 00:01:54,380
I'm not.

33
00:01:54,532 --> 00:01:55,484
Why are you here?

34
00:01:55,638 --> 00:01:56,133
What do you think?

35
00:01:56,742 --> 00:01:57,999
Given your special status,

36
00:01:58,113 --> 00:02:00,094
I already told Xuan Yazhe
he couldn't take you out of Huyun,

37
00:02:00,552 --> 00:02:02,647
but he went and did it anyway.

38
00:02:03,066 --> 00:02:03,560
Relax.

39
00:02:03,903 --> 00:02:05,085
He didn't do anything to me.

40
00:02:05,884 --> 00:02:06,570
Where is Xuan Yazhe?

41
00:02:13,922 --> 00:02:14,722
Xi Yuan!

42
00:02:15,408 --> 00:02:16,399
Xi Yuan!

43
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:38,151
Yunlie, save me!

44
00:02:44,742 --> 00:02:45,276
Yunlie.

45
00:02:45,809 --> 00:02:47,103
You did that on purpose!

46
00:02:47,103 --> 00:02:47,904
You're getting back at me.

47
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:01,427
I only took Xi Yuan away once.

48
00:03:01,427 --> 00:03:02,608
Did you have to do that?

49
00:03:02,838 --> 00:03:03,827
And now you're playing the victim?

50
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,541
I know I was wrong.

51
00:03:11,828 --> 00:03:13,009
He knows he was wrong.

52
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,419
Just forgive him.

53
00:03:21,808 --> 00:03:22,190
Sand...

54
00:03:22,838 --> 00:03:23,713
Sandworms!

55
00:03:26,303 --> 00:03:26,684
Run!

56
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,351
Jin Yunlie.

57
00:03:57,771 --> 00:03:58,609
Outside Huyun,

58
00:03:59,218 --> 00:04:01,047
you won't be so lucky.

59
00:04:04,018 --> 00:04:05,580
Once you're dead,

60
00:04:05,922 --> 00:04:06,761
the Xuanji Jade

61
00:04:07,752 --> 00:04:10,038
will fall into the hands of Longyuan.

62
00:04:54,304 --> 00:04:55,219
My Spiritual Power is restricted.

63
00:04:55,752 --> 00:04:57,352
I can't summon the Myriad Gold Chains.

64
00:04:57,542 --> 00:04:58,495
What do we do?

65
00:04:58,684 --> 00:04:59,713
This is all my fault.

66
00:04:59,866 --> 00:05:00,475
I acted on impulse

67
00:05:01,161 --> 00:05:02,799
and got everyone into this mess.

68
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:05,085
Are we all going to die here?

69
00:05:06,952 --> 00:05:08,208
You sealed the demon within your body.

70
00:05:08,552 --> 00:05:10,837
Demonic Energy can rapidly
advance your cultivation,

71
00:05:11,065 --> 00:05:12,590
but one wrong thought can send you
down the demonic path.

72
00:05:12,666 --> 00:05:13,428
Remember,

73
00:05:14,227 --> 00:05:15,676
unless you have no other choice,

74
00:05:16,590 --> 00:05:17,808
do not break the seal.

75
00:05:17,922 --> 00:05:18,380
(Looks like)

76
00:05:18,875 --> 00:05:19,713
(this is my only option.)

77
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:38,760
(Liuyue, a girl from Huyun)

78
00:05:39,447 --> 00:05:40,589
One-hit kill.

79
00:05:54,152 --> 00:05:54,914
Stay behind me.

80
00:06:00,857 --> 00:06:02,037
The Zhongtu Bandits.

81
00:06:02,494 --> 00:06:03,522
Bandits?

82
00:06:09,351 --> 00:06:10,457
What do you want?

83
00:06:10,608 --> 00:06:12,018
Yunlie is really powerful.

84
00:06:12,247 --> 00:06:13,314
Stay back!

85
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,638
(So alike.)

86
00:06:16,514 --> 00:06:17,580
(Truly alike.)

87
00:07:05,313 --> 00:07:06,571
Liuyue again.

88
00:07:07,409 --> 00:07:09,580
You rely on that dragon-bone sword

89
00:07:10,113 --> 00:07:11,409
to ruin my plans time and again.

90
00:07:12,932 --> 00:07:14,304
The Demon Lord's plan

91
00:07:14,837 --> 00:07:16,018
cannot fail because of you.

92
00:07:21,084 --> 00:07:22,419
This works out nicely.

93
00:07:23,142 --> 00:07:23,676
This time,

94
00:07:24,247 --> 00:07:26,457
you'll be buried with them.

95
00:07:42,684 --> 00:07:43,408
Xi Yuan!

96
00:07:43,637 --> 00:07:44,628
Stop struggling.

97
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:45,809
What's wrong with you two?

98
00:07:45,884 --> 00:07:47,218
Why aren't you fighting back?

99
00:07:47,942 --> 00:07:49,428
Zhongtu bandits can't cultivate.

100
00:07:49,770 --> 00:07:51,714
They survive by robbing merchants

101
00:07:51,714 --> 00:07:53,046
traveling through the four kingdoms.

102
00:07:54,037 --> 00:07:54,380
These spirit-binding ropes

103
00:07:54,723 --> 00:07:56,856
were made to restrain those
with Spiritual Power.

104
00:07:57,922 --> 00:07:59,180
No one but their owner

105
00:07:59,180 --> 00:08:00,246
can undo these ropes.

106
00:08:00,703 --> 00:08:03,295
So we can't even beat
ordinary people now?

107
00:08:03,295 --> 00:08:04,857
Xi Yuan, listen.

108
00:08:04,932 --> 00:08:06,913
The bandits here are notorious lechers.

109
00:08:07,409 --> 00:08:08,741
They love abducting people to marry.

110
00:08:09,656 --> 00:08:10,495
But don't worry.

111
00:08:10,685 --> 00:08:11,409
I'll protect you.

112
00:08:13,084 --> 00:08:15,600
You're pretty well informed.

113
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:15,942
Xi Yuan.

114
00:08:16,476 --> 00:08:17,237
I'll protect you.

115
00:08:17,237 --> 00:08:17,542
Hmm.

116
00:08:17,542 --> 00:08:18,723
You?

117
00:08:18,723 --> 00:08:19,447
Get lost.

118
00:08:21,389 --> 00:08:21,732
You...

119
00:08:22,038 --> 00:08:23,294
What are you going to do to me?

120
00:08:23,485 --> 00:08:23,980
Stay away!

121
00:08:24,438 --> 00:08:24,932
Xi Yuan!

122
00:08:26,457 --> 00:08:26,952
You'll do.

123
00:08:27,675 --> 00:08:28,019
Move.

124
00:08:28,704 --> 00:08:31,219
You're marrying our chief today.

125
00:08:31,256 --> 00:08:32,246
You'll be our chief's captive spouse.

126
00:08:34,265 --> 00:08:34,608
Move!

127
00:08:35,294 --> 00:08:35,638
Go!

128
00:08:36,704 --> 00:08:38,571
Didn't you say the Zhongtu chief
was lustful?

129
00:08:38,571 --> 00:08:39,676
Why did they take Jin Yunlie?

130
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:41,160
Move!

131
00:08:41,846 --> 00:08:43,027
I didn't know

132
00:08:43,104 --> 00:08:45,009
he was into men!

133
00:08:45,466 --> 00:08:47,066
Don't worry, Yunlie.

134
00:08:47,484 --> 00:08:48,551
After you're married,

135
00:08:48,551 --> 00:08:49,809
I'll take care of Xi Yuan.

136
00:08:49,809 --> 00:08:50,189
Shut up!

137
00:08:50,189 --> 00:08:50,532
Move!

138
00:08:52,703 --> 00:08:53,123
Chief.

139
00:08:53,352 --> 00:08:54,190
We brought him back.

140
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,280
Chief, he's here.

141
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,280
We brought him back.

142
00:09:18,609 --> 00:09:20,208
What a handsome man.

143
00:09:20,704 --> 00:09:23,675
Tonight is our wedding night.

144
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:27,066
- The bandit chief is a woman?
- The bandit chief is a woman?

145
00:09:27,752 --> 00:09:28,361
Get away from me!

146
00:09:28,361 --> 00:09:29,200
Oh my.

147
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,380
You've got quite a temper.

148
00:09:30,495 --> 00:09:31,484
Not bad, not bad.

149
00:09:31,676 --> 00:09:33,085
Wild. I like it.

150
00:09:34,571 --> 00:09:35,408
A'Er.

151
00:09:35,408 --> 00:09:36,095
Bring the wedding veil.

152
00:09:36,095 --> 00:09:36,895
You got it.

153
00:09:39,333 --> 00:09:40,400
It'd be a shame

154
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,923
- to cover that face.
- You must have a death wish.

155
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,760
Let go of me!

156
00:10:05,504 --> 00:10:06,760
My beautiful groom's got quite a temper.

157
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,056
Be careful with him.

158
00:10:08,056 --> 00:10:09,465
Don't hurt his face.

159
00:10:10,723 --> 00:10:11,599
Yunlie.

160
00:10:12,094 --> 00:10:14,151
He's quite the charmer.

161
00:10:14,341 --> 00:10:15,942
What a time to admire him.

162
00:10:16,666 --> 00:10:18,609
If he really marries that chief,

163
00:10:18,913 --> 00:10:20,590
what am I supposed to do?

164
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:29,800
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

165
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:36,600
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

166
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:43,400
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

167
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:50,200
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
